items.problem:
When count×80 is more than the stage width − 8, UI.actions (ui.js:49) builds a one-row .acttray with a hidden scrollbar (style.css:216-218). That means 5 or more choices in portrait, 9 or more in landSmall and 11 or more in land. Only 5 choices show (4 on a 375 px phone), and these stay hidden:
- the TV's 🚽📢🫧👸;
- the keyboard's 🌙🚀🌸;
- the gym's 🧘🌀⭐⚪;
- the table's ⬇️ 'put the dish here';
- Nunu's and Jeff's 😜 while she holds a dish;
- 4 of the 9 tree-house toys.
The alert circles (top:64, z7) are drawn over tray choices. On landSmall the TV and gym lists become a strip that hides the whole TV, although a two-row ring would fit.

