  - Jeff's dish bubble: approach(jeff.x, () => { const a = entActions(jeff).find(x => x.ico === '🍽️'); a && a.fn(); }, 26). His first 🍽️ is serve; the second is pressureEat;
  - pictures keep Pics.gift(h.url, e);
